的蔥味很重\n豆腐沒有到很嫩\n\n*溏心蛋\n沒什麼醬油醃漬的味道\n蛋黃沒有完美比例，接近偏熟的溏心蛋\n\n*奶酪🥛\n奶味超級重、甜度也不會很甜\n\n*布丁🍮\n香味濃、沒什麼細孔、甜度剛好\n沒看到焦糖卻有焦糖香氣，很厲害🤩\n（布丁\u003e奶酪）\n\n整體：\n麻奶湯底、涼拌豆腐、泰奶［拉完了］\n推布丁、起司可樂餅",null,[0,33]]]],[null,1783178089000000,1783178089000000,"1 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfMUdDTnppeHZyMF9LYlRvcGtrQ1FBQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfMUdDTnppeHZyMF9LYlRvcGtrQ1FBQRoTQ2d3STZjYWswZ1lRd1l6cnpRRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiV2p-FxtKWAxUHbfUHHSN8ARwQ_2MIkwEoIw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXUkdKWVp6UlpVekZSVTBkNGVHVlhWbkJOUlhNeVZtdGFUMlF4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXUkdKWVp6UlpVekZSVTBkNGVHVlhWbkJOUlhNeVZtdGFUMlF4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXUkdKWVp6UlpVekZSVTBkNGVHVlhWbkJOUlhNeVZtdGFUMlF4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXUkdKWVp6UlpVekZSVTBkNGVHVlhWbkJOUlhNeVZtdGFUMlF4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXUkdKWVp6UlpVekZSVTBkNGVHVlhWbkJOUlhNeVZtdGFUMlF4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXUkdKWVp6UlpVekZSVTBkNGVHVlhWbkJOUlhNeVZtdGFUMlF4UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["評錯地方了，這邊是板橋雙十店江子翠",null,[0,17]]]],[null,null,7597,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWRGJYZzRZUzFRU0d4eGVXVnBNRXMyVmtaT2QxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x874f98aaac4b06fc!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjVDbXg4YS1QSGxxeWVpMEs2VkZOd1E%7C%7C?hl\u003d