xtKWAxUHbfUHHSN8ARwQ3YcHCNIBKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiV2p-FxtKWAxUHbfUHHSN8ARwQ3IcHCNEBKA0",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["二鬼麵鋪整體環境乾淨明亮，座位與動線規劃清楚，用餐感受不錯。點餐可透過線上系統完成，並支援 LINE Pay 付款，流程順暢，對習慣行動支付的人相當方便。這次嘗試了炸雞、麻辣奶香與酸菜口味，整體表現都有水準。炸雞尤其出色，麵衣口感蓬鬆酥香，不是傳統厚重型，但咬下去層次分明，很有記憶點。\n\n麻辣奶香風味濃厚，不過辣味起司奶香版本辣度非常高，對不太能吃辣的人來說湯幾乎無法入口，點餐前需斟酌。酸菜口味相對順口耐吃。酸梅湯則偏甜，個人口味不太適應，若不嗜甜可考慮其他飲品。整體而言仍值得一試。",null,[0,143]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrUW1WSFNucFRiR3hGVjBVMVVWSnJWbTFhTURGVFRsVktiVnB1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrUW1WSFNucFRiR3hGVjBVMVVWSnJWbTFhTURGVFRsVktiVnB1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrUW1WSFNucFRiR3hGVjBVMVVWSnJWbTFhTURGVFRsVktiVnB1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrUW1WSFNucFRiR3hGVjBVMVVWSnJWbTFhTURGVFRsVktiVnB1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrUW1WSFNucFRiR3hGVjBVMVVWSnJWbTFhTURGVFRsVktiVnB1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13432389466297987036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrUW1WSFNucFRiR3hGVjBVMVVWSnJWbTFhTURGVFRsVktiVnB1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,4222,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkQmVHSnpTbGxFV0U1UVJrVm1aMDFTTlVKbVpuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x874f98aaac4b06fc!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjdBeGJzSllEWE5QRkVmZ01SNUJmZnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkQmVHSnpTbGxFV0U1UVJrV